sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Depositor or staff
  participant APP as Deposit app (H3, Argo-B3, sdr-api)
  participant DSA as DSA
  participant ROB as Robots (common-accessioning)
  participant PF as purl-fetcher
  participant PRES as preservation_robots and pres cat
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant K as Kafka and indexers

  U->>APP: describe item, upload files
  APP->>DSA: POST /v1/objects (HTTPS JWT)
  DSA-->>APP: druid, version 1 open
  APP->>APP: stage files on NFS
  APP->>DSA: close version (or start assemblyWF)
  DSA->>ROB: accessionWF steps (Sidekiq)
  ROB->>DSA: step status (HTTPS)
  DSA->>PF: publish: PUT /v1/purls/:druid
  PF->>PF: write /stacks, public cocina and XML
  par after publish: release
    DSA->>PF: releaseWF: release tags
    PF->>K: release message (Kafka)
    K->>K: index into SearchWorks or EarthWorks Solr
  and preservation
    DSA->>PRES: sdr-ingest-transfer: bag in /dor/export
    PRES->>PRES: build Moab, validate, catalog
    PRES->>DSA: complete sdr-ingest-received
  end
  DSA->>MQ: end-accession.completed (AMQP)
  MQ-->>APP: deposit complete
  Note over PRES: Later and asynchronously: replicate zip parts to AWS and GCP
